        bots: [["Just learned how the horse moves.", "Hi! Is the horse the one that jumps?", "Wait, I won? Yay!", "Good game! You're really good."], ["Loves pushing pawns. All of them.", "Pawns forward! That's the whole plan.", "My pawns did it!", "Next time I'll push even more pawns."], ["Spots a free piece. Sometimes.", "Leave a piece hanging and it's mine.", "Told you I'd find something.", "Okay, you got me. Nice one."], ["Club newcomer with a bit of a temper.", "Let's keep it clean. No silly blunders.", "That's how it's done.", "Hmph. Well played, I suppose."], ["Knows her openings, sometimes forgets her queen.", "I studied openings all week. Ready?", "Theory wins again.", "My prep ran out. Good game."], ["Sees tactics fast. Endgames, less so.", "Watch out for forks. I love forks.", "Tactics never lie.", "You out-calculated me. Respect."], ["Punishes loose pieces without mercy.", "Every loose piece is a gift to me.", "Loose pieces drop off.", "Very solid. I couldn't find a way in."], ["Calculates deep and plays for the win.", "I don't play for draws.", "Precise to the end.", "Impressive. You earned that."], ["Patient, precise, almost never blunders.", "Take your time. I'll take mine.", "Small edges add up.", "Excellent game. Truly."], ["The final boss. Bring your best.", "You made it to the top. Let's see why.", "As expected.", "Remarkable. Few get past me."]],
